The motion rules in explode.js (one spring per part, staggered open with the outside part first,
reversal that reschedules only what changes, transform removed at rest, one lit part with the rest
stepped down, labels that end on dots, loop that sleeps when settled or offscreen, reduced-motion jump,
idle tour) are taken from the "anatomy" skill. No anatomy code is copied; the patterns are re-implemented.

